        "title": "»pomSoft 2« - intelligent inspection",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The special ZOLLER software »pomSoft 2« for process-oriented measurement is based on the globally proven ZOLLER image processing »pilot 4.0« and is equipped with numerous evaluation algorithms for grinding and sharpening companies as well as tool manufacturers. In addition, all functions can be individually created and saved for the respective inspection task and tool variant in the customer-specific menu. This means that it can be used clearly and independently of the operator, without the need for extensive training.</p>",
